    "text": "I, as the Minister in charge of Local Government of Western Province, hereby notify under the powers vested on me underSection 04 of the Licensing of Clubs Act No. 15 of 1989, that it has been decided the fee to be charged for licenses issued withregard to each Local authority under Licensing of Clubs Act No. 17 of 1975, related to clubs maintained in the administrativelimits of Municipal Council, Urban Councils and Pradeshiya Sabha of Western Province, shall be in the manner mentioned inthe following schedule.",
